<view class="page"><view class="panel"><text class="title">订单实操</text><text class="sub">处理异常订单，观察售后指标变化。</text><view class="order"><text>待处理订单</text><text class="big">{{orders.pending}}</text></view><view class="order"><text>已发货 {{orders.shipped}} 件</text><text>已送达 {{orders.delivered}} 件</text></view><text class="stat">当前退款率：{{orders.refundRate}}%</text><button bindtap="onResolve">处理一笔异常订单</button><button bindtap="onBack">返回店铺</button></view></view>